  ok   premier future: refuses stale keys in later seasons, other years and changed league membership
  ok   premier rollover: clears the real fixture key after a fully played season before generating the next season
  ok   premier baseline: matches the base engine for unsupported starts and genuine match outcomes
  ok   premier uncopied: passes the whole base comparison with untouched current source under every copied fault
